Package: libgstreamer-plugins-bad1.0-0
Architecture: any
Multi-Arch: same
Pre-Depends: ${misc:Pre-Depends}
Depends: ${misc:Depends},
         ${shlibs:Depends}
Description: GStreamer libraries from the "bad" set
 GStreamer is a streaming media framework, based on graphs of filters
 which operate on media data.  Its plugin-based architecture means that
 new data types or processing capabilities can be added simply by
 installing new plug-ins.
 .
 This package contains the shared libraries of the "bad" set: the DXA
 converter, the RTP/RTCP libraries and the GStreamer GL integration for
 the Vulkan path.
 .
 This build has no X11 support. The package therefore has no dependency on
 libxkbcommon-x11-0 and none on libxkbcommon0, so the outdated libxkbcommon
 1.7.0-2 from trixie cannot be dragged into the system. See README.md in
 the crick Debian backports repository.

