Architecture: any
Multi-Arch: same
Section: libdevel
Depends: ${gir:Depends},
         ${misc:Depends},
         ${shlibs:Depends},
         gir1.2-gst-plugins-bad-1.0 (= ${binary:Version}),
         libgstreamer1.0-dev (>= 1.16.2),
         libgstreamer-plugins-base1.0-dev (>= 1.16.2)
Provides: ${gir:Provides}
Description: GStreamer development files for libraries from the "bad" set
 GStreamer is a streaming media framework, based on graphs of filters
 which operate on media data.  Its plugin-based architecture means that
 new data types or processing capabilities can be added simply by
 installing new plug-ins.
 .
 This package contains the headers, the pkg-config files and the
 introspection data of the "bad" set.

Package: gstreamer1.0-plugins-bad
Architecture: any
Section: plugins
Multi-Arch: same
Depends: ${misc:Depends},
         ${shlibs:Depends},
         gstreamer1.0-plugins-base (>= 1.28.0),
         gstreamer1.0-plugins-good (>= 1.28.0),
         libgstreamer-plugins-bad1.0-0 (= ${binary:Version})
Description: GStreamer plugins from the "bad" set
 GStreamer is a streaming media framework, based on graphs of filters
 which operate on media data.  Its plugin-based architecture means that
 new data types or processing capabilities can be added simply by
 installing new plug-ins.
 .
 This package contains the elements of the "bad" set: the VDPAU-free
 hardware decoding elements (VA-API, oneVPL, NVENC/NVDEC through the
 FFmpeg library, Vulkan), the audio decoders that are not in the "good"
 set, the RTP/RTCP elements, the subtitle renderers and the video
 converters.
 .
 This build has no X11 support, no DVB tuner support and no optical disc
 support.

Package: gir1.2-gst-plugins-bad-1.0
Architecture: any
Section: introspection
Multi-Arch: same
Depends: ${gir:Depends},
         ${misc:Depends},
         ${shlibs:Depends}
Provides: ${gir:Provides}
Description: GObject introspection data for the GStreamer "bad" libraries
 This package contains GObject introspection data for the shared
 libraries of the "bad" set of the GStreamer streaming media framework.

